Package: PURSUE
Type: Package
Title: Two-Part Differential Abundance Analysis for Microbiome Count Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Robertas", family = "Tupikas", email = "robertast.tupikas@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Differential abundance analysis for 16S OTU/ASV count tables with two
    separately reported components. The abundance component is a linear model on log
    relative abundance over detected cells with a log-depth covariate, empirical-Bayes
    variance moderation (limma) and empirical-null mixture centring of effect estimates
    across features. The presence component is a per-feature zero-inflated negative
    binomial with a depth offset, cross-feature dispersion shrinkage and a ridge-penalised
    presence logit, tested by likelihood ratio. Both components accept arbitrary
    model formulas.
